{
  "name": "Full Shopify Store Product Catalog, Variants & SKU Exporter to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Full Shopify Store Product Catalog, Variants & SKU Exporter to Google Sheets\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExport any Shopify store’s entire product catalog including images, variant prices, SKU codes, and stock timestamps.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/shopify-store-product-catalog-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/shopify-store-product-catalog-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Shopify Store Scraper - Full Product Catalog** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "bf8803b9-19e8-49f3-ac15-079d531e4265",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Shopify Store Scraper - Full Product Catalog** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "fb13a3fd-71d7-4bb1-a908-66055ce2ca28",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "c9966888-8a02-4e54-ac8c-1e5376104a23",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "0d988257-efb1-48f5-af28-343655c589fc",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e517354f-a0a7-4252-abff-13fdfa41e45c",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"kith.com\",\"brooklinen.com\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "a0d9e5fe-acfd-44ae-a244-2fd3b9d72989",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "e0388eac-cdc8-49a8-a34d-c5ac5e044782",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "E-Commerce",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3a401602-667e-4faa-aa06-0e09d8984809",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/laborious_rumor~shopify-store-product-catalog-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
